        {
          "name": "ai_scraper",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:f899a1a2cfc174dbf9ec909dda30cab2e793b68eac20bdebd3895ce82ef1f0a7",
          "description": "Create an AI Scraper task for an explicit Scrapeless actor, then poll every 5 seconds until the answer is ready or the timeout is reached. Supports ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot, Google AI Mode, Google AI Overview, Grok, and Alexa. Defaults to a 3 minute timeout. The timeout can be set from 60 to 600 seconds. On timeout, returns the task_id and instructions for manually fetching the result.",
